<div class="graphics-article-title" >
 Pat O'Rourke (Chilligan's Island) in FW20 Light Outerwear + Rugby's
</div>
<div class="centered-article-text">
  <p>
    We like people that don't take themselves too seriously, but do take their work seriously. That’s why we were immediately drawn towards Pat O’Rourke's instagram page <a href="https://www.instagram.com/chilligansisland/?hl=en" target="_blank">@chilligansisland</a>. The name is funny, but the photos are seriously good. With everyone having access to a good camera in their pocket, the barrier of entry to being a photographer is all but gone. The differentiator, now more than ever, is the focus. 
    <br/><br/>
    Pat’s work, whether he is shooting with an iPhone, point-and-shoot, or a more “professional” rig; always shows a keen eye for seeing and enjoying the little things in life. We wanted to support that, so we sent our latest release up to him in Canada and had his girlfriend <a href="https://www.instagram.com/rebeccaramsdale/" target="_blank">Rebecca Ramsdale</a> turn the camera on him as he wears the new Marsu Jackets, Expedition Fleece’s, and Rugby shirts.
  </p>
</div>

