<div class="centered-article-text">
  <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; max-width: 500px; margin: 20px auto;">
 	Our Marsu (aka “Marsupial”) jacket gets it’s name from its ample stow pockets. The pockets have been given double to triple the volume of a regular hand pocket on a coat due to the darts added to the pocket construction. Noteworthy advancements on the FW20 Marsu Jacket style include a higher durability main body three layer fabric sourced from Japan, new breathable three layer taping, silicone cuff adjusters and custom silicone zip pulls on the pit, pocket, and center front zips. The Marsu is a perfect all-around hard shell, and good for all seasons.
  </p>
</div>


