<div class="centered-article-text">
  <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; max-width: 500px; margin: 20px auto;">
 	Returning to the FW20 lineup, the Expedition Fleece has been reworked in dark charcoal and beige colorways. Combination fabric used on the neck and center front zipper placket has been changed to a wool blend rip stop, equally as tough as the past season grosgrain, but slightly more supple. We’ve continued to use the “wrong" side of the high pile sherpa fleece fabric, utilizing the pile side of the fabric on the interior of the jacket. Pilling will occur on the exterior of the jacket but we’ve knowingly produced the jacket this way. The jacket’s chest stow pocket has a Japanese spec YKK coil zip closure with a large silicone loop pull that can be easily grabbed with any type of glove on. Elastic cord locks keep drafts out of the waist opening of our heavy fleece jacket style. 
  </p>
</div>

