<div class="centered-article-text">
  <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; max-width: 500px; margin: 20px auto;">
    New to FW20 is the Zip Front Rugby Shirt, milled from durable 400 GSM combed cotton with a soft hand feel. We used a locking YKK zipper set into the front placket instead of tradition rubber buttons. Rubber buttons were a clever innovation for the sport of rugby so that buttons would flex and come undone rather than pop off when the shirt was pulled on. Our zipper front makes it easier to take the shirt off and on and will hold the desired zipper position when being worn. The collar uses the same 2-ply twill found on our FW20 banks banks, dyed to match the base color of each colorway from the custom milled jersey. Shirts fit slightly oversized as we think a rugby shirt should never be fitted.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="centered-article-text">
